<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines sees 1996 trade deficit over $12 bln.</title>
<headline>Philippines sees 1996 trade deficit over $12 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' 1996 trade deficit is expected to reach over $12 billion, the Philippine Central Bank's managing director for research Amando Tetangco told Reuters Financial Television on Friday.</p>
</text>
